 rulesSpecialties:
 'The mainland export airports are Beijing Capital (PEK), Shanghai Pudong (PVG) and Guangzhou Baiyun (CAN). HKG is a via-Hong-Kong routing note, not the origin and not an AFCD export. The UAE file is a MOCCAE import permit valid for 90 days from issuance, and an ISO microchip that matches the certificate. When a rabies antibody test is required, the result must be at least 0.5 IU/ml; the certificate is valid for 365 days if the vaccine stays valid and continuous and no booster is given; otherwise repeat the test; a first vaccine or a gap needs at least 21 days before the test; a valid booster does not; the blood sample is taken within 90 days before travel, not as a wait after the draw. Confirm any exemption on the MOCCAE portal. Air China, China Eastern, Emirates and Cathay Pacific are cargo. There is no Qatar Airways row. A local pet licence does not replace the permit.',
 difficulties:
 'The via-Hong-Kong note is easy to misread. A crate tendered at HKG as if it were the mainland origin builds an AFCD file, not a PEK, PVG or CAN export. A connection through HKG still needs the mainland port on the certificate. Air China, China Eastern, Emirates and Cathay Pacific are cargo, so a business-class seat is not a cabin place into Dubai. Issue the MOCCAE permit against a cargo date you can book. It lasts 90 days from issuance. A slipped via-HKG connection burns that window in the same way as a cancelled Pudong lift. If a titer is required, use the certificate rule in the route rules, not a 90-day wait after a Shanghai blood draw. A Beijing certificate with a Pudong air waybill is a split file. Cathay on a via-HKG path is not permission to start the crate at HKG.',
 howItWorks:
 'Take a household leaving a Pudong apartment with one cat. About three months out, confirm the export airport is Shanghai Pudong (PVG), not HKG. Confirm UAE breed eligibility and check the MOCCAE portal for a titer. If a test is required, keep the certificate valid for the travel date. About two months out, confirm cargo with Air China, China Eastern, Emirates or Cathay Pacific. If a via-Hong-Kong routing appears, treat HKG as a connection, not as the origin and not as an AFCD export. About five to three weeks out, apply for the MOCCAE import permit so the 90 days from issuance cover the PVG, PEK or CAN date. If the via-HKG sector is later refused, rebuild around a direct mainland cargo date and reissue the permit if the window no longer fits. In the last fortnight, match the mainland code on the export papers and the air waybill, and check the crate. Arrival release is at DXB or DWC.',
 airportsNarrative:
 'The mainland export airports are Beijing Capital (PEK), Shanghai Pudong (PVG) and Guangzhou Baiyun (CAN). Those three are the China gateways on this route. HKG is listed only as a via-Hong-Kong note. It is not a fourth mainland airport, and it is not a claim that Hong Kong is the origin. If the animal is actually leaving Hong Kong, that is the AFCD export route. A household in Suzhou still files PVG when Pudong is the export port. Chengdu, Shenzhen and Xian are not on this route. Capital, Pudong and Baiyun cargo villages are separate campuses. UAE release is at Dubai International (DXB) or Al Maktoum / Dubai World Central (DWC). Abu Dhabi International (AUH) applies only if Etihad is booked, and Etihad is not on the China carrier list. A via-HKG connection adds Chek Lap Kok as a handling point. Name PEK, PVG or CAN on the certificate, the air waybill and the MOCCAE file.',
 airlinesNarrative:
 'The carriers named here are Air China (cargo), China Eastern (cargo), Emirates (cargo) and Cathay Pacific (cargo). There is no cabin-or-cargo flag. Confirm the current policy for the mainland city pair before you pay. Air China cargo at PEK is not Air China passenger inventory, and it is not cabin into Dubai. China Eastern at PVG can close to live animals in a given week, so ask. Emirates cargo from a mainland port is a different booking from Emirates via HKG. Cathay Pacific often appears when a via-Hong-Kong routing is in play. The export file still needs PEK, PVG or CAN as the origin. There is no Qatar Airways row. Switching airports is a new cargo file. Dubai Pet Relocation coordinates the booking. It does not fly the aircraft. Reconfirm crate and breed limits in the week of travel.',
